{"$schema":"vscode://schemas/color-theme","_papyrus":{"direction":"Jewel Noir (v2) — four saturated poles on an ash field over true black: ember keywords, gold classes, electric-verdigris functions, bone numbers. Fixes the old 'Lamplight but dimmer' identity and the class==error hue collision. Warm rule intact (no blue/purple/magenta).","roles":{"keyword":"#C86038 ember","function":"#3FC8AE electric verdigris","string":"#A8B478 ash olive","classType":"#E8A230 gold","number":"#EDE2C6 bone","annotation":"#C9A86A bronze","selfThis":"#FF8814 hot ember (the flare)","error":"#D26A55 clay (damage only)","ink":"#CFC4A8 warm ash"},"emberRule":"#FF8814 hot ember is the flare — self/this only, plus TUI remember/prompt shimmer. Keyword ember #C86038 is smoked so the flare stays rare.","chrome":"Chrome fields near-black per repo state. Accent pass done: identity accents (badge, active tab, focus, progress, peek) = ember #C86038; links = verdigris #3FC8AE; WARNING keys stay amber #D89060 so amber always means caution. Charts untouched (spectral slots).","spec":"Full rationale in deliverables/design-docs/papyrus-noir-design-language.md. Single source of truth: papyrus-palettes.js."},"name":"Papyrus Noir","type":"dark","colors":{"foreground":"#CFC4A8","editor.background":"#000000","editor.foreground":"#CFC4A8","editor.lineHighlightBackground":"#0C0A06","editor.selectionBackground":"#3A2E1880","editor.inactiveSelectionBackground":"#3A2E1840","editor.selectionHighlightBackground":"#3A2E1880","editor.wordHighlightBackground":"#3A2E1840","editor.wordHighlightStrongBackground":"#3A2E1880","editor.findMatchBackground":"#DDA06570","editor.findMatchHighlightBackground":"#DDA06530","editorLineNumber.foreground":"#4F4838","editorLineNumber.activeForeground":"#AAA088","editorCursor.foreground":"#3FC8AE","editorWhitespace.foreground":"#13100A","editorIndentGuide.background1":"#13100A","editorIndentGuide.activeBackground1":"#4F4838","editorBracketMatch.background":"#3A2E1880","editorBracketMatc